Value Required NEIGHBOR_ID (\S+)
Value INSTANCE (\S+)
Value VRF (\S+)
Value ADDRESS (\S+)
Value AREA (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value STATE (\S.*?)

# One record per adjacency (feature 011, research R3). Priority, state change count, ages, the
# neighbour's view of the DR and BDR, options, dead and inactivity timers, retransmissions and
# graceful restart are not captured (FR-007).
Start
  ^Neighbor -> Continue.Record
  ^Neighbor ${NEIGHBOR_ID}, instance ${INSTANCE}, VRF ${VRF}, interface address ${ADDRESS}$$
  ^\s+In area ${AREA} interface ${INTERFACE}$$
  ^\s+Neighbor priority is \d+, State is ${STATE}, \d+ state changes?$$
